      "title": "The Great Sphinx isn't a woman（ギザのスフィンクスは、女ではない）",
      "text": "The Great Sphinx of Giza is not a woman. It has a lion's body and the face of a king, in the royal headcloth of a pharaoh. Hatshepsut, a woman who ruled as pharaoh, appears as a sphinx too, with a king's ceremonial beard.",
